1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:34,610
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:35,670
Hurry up!

3
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:36,640
On my way!

4
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:37,710
Let's go.

5
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,080
Go take a look.

6
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,390
See?

7
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:47,800
Look! They're going upstream!

8
00:00:49,030 --> 00:00:50,000
Aren't they going backwards?

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:50,430
Look!

10
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:52,130
Over there!

11
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:03,840
Jialiang!

12
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:05,640
Jiashu!

13
00:01:09,150 --> 00:01:09,760
Jialiang!

14
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:11,039
Jiashu!

15
00:01:11,789 --> 00:01:12,430
Jiashu!

16
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,530
Jialiang!

17
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:14,810
Jiashu!

18
00:01:14,950 --> 00:01:16,760
The immortal children descend.

19
00:01:17,010 --> 00:01:19,120
Against the current, the corpses go.

20
00:01:26,789 --> 00:01:27,560
Jialiang!

21
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,039
Brother.

22
00:01:44,509 --> 00:01:45,350
Stepmother?

23
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:47,400
Your father is dead.

24
00:01:49,229 --> 00:01:51,030
Your younger brother and sister

25
00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:53,920
are also dead.

26
00:01:58,789 --> 00:01:59,479
No...

27
00:02:01,590 --> 00:02:02,310
Feiyan...

28
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:04,640
Feiyan.

29
00:02:05,350 --> 00:02:07,410
I need to get an explanation from her.

30
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:11,000
Scam!

31
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:15,240
The whole thing is a scam!

32
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:16,329
Chengming.

33
00:02:20,590 --> 00:02:21,560
Feiyan!

34
00:02:39,910 --> 00:02:40,800
Scam...

35
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,630
Feiyan...

36
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:45,430
This is a scam!

37
00:02:46,430 --> 00:02:47,360
Feiyan.

38
00:02:47,870 --> 00:02:50,280
This is all a scam!

39
00:02:50,630 --> 00:02:51,960
Jiang Feiyan!

40
00:02:54,150 --> 00:02:56,710
The whole thing is a scam!

41
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:02,150
You are a jinx.

42
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:06,240
You got

43
00:03:06,710 --> 00:03:09,070
the whole family killed.

44
00:03:58,590 --> 00:03:59,910
What took you so long?

45
00:05:51,270 --> 00:05:54,970
[A Prophet]

46
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,909
[Episode 1]

47
00:05:59,260 --> 00:06:02,470
[Pangzhou]

48
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:28,830
Master Hu.

49
00:06:29,330 --> 00:06:32,440
[Hu Guangyuan, Tianxiang Sect]

50
00:06:33,070 --> 00:06:34,400
Who are you, gentleman?

51
00:06:34,659 --> 00:06:36,120
"The founder left 3 treasures.

52
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:38,250
All disciples got real inheritance."

53
00:06:41,190 --> 00:06:42,870
"Qian harmonizes with Kun, with Li and Kan in balance.

54
00:06:42,870 --> 00:06:43,070
[Du Gui, Tianxiang Sect]

55
00:06:43,070 --> 00:06:44,980
Our fame spreads across every land."

56
00:06:44,980 --> 00:06:46,430
"Zhen, Xun, Gen, and Dui create the wind.

57
00:06:46,430 --> 00:06:48,270
We gather from all corners to make our mark."

58
00:06:48,270 --> 00:06:48,830
You got

59
00:06:49,070 --> 00:06:50,070
all the passwords right.

60
00:06:50,070 --> 00:06:51,950
I am Mu Zilian's 33rd-generation disciple,

61
00:06:51,950 --> 00:06:52,630
Lyu Ruhui.

62
00:06:52,750 --> 00:06:53,920
Greetings, Master Hu.

63
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:54,630
Good.

64
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,770
Come with us.

65
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:05,980
[Yaxin Grand Hotel]

66
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:14,500
The place you arranged is really fancy, Master Hu.

67
00:07:14,500 --> 00:07:16,260
This is a big job.

68
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,950
I can't risk anything going wrong.

69
00:07:17,950 --> 00:07:18,720
So,

70
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,040
sorry for the rough journey.

71
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,640
It's our first time meeting,

72
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,800
but I've heard

73
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,750
a lot about you in Pujiang.

74
00:07:25,300 --> 00:07:25,900
Master Hu,

75
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,240
you can ask me to do anything.

76
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,390
I'm at your command.

77
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:29,430
Master,

78
00:07:29,430 --> 00:07:30,390
the room is ready.

79
00:07:30,390 --> 00:07:30,950
Okay.

80
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:32,950
This is Du Gui.

81
00:07:32,950 --> 00:07:34,240
He works for me.

82
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,270
In terms of seniority,

83
00:07:35,270 --> 00:07:36,800
you should call him senior.

84
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,040
Senior Gui.

85
00:07:38,790 --> 00:07:39,400
Gui,

86
00:07:39,430 --> 00:07:41,720
take Ruhui to the room to freshen up.

87
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,920
You're in room 203.

88
00:07:44,310 --> 00:07:44,920
Okay.

89
00:07:46,159 --> 00:07:46,580
See you.

90
00:07:46,580 --> 00:07:47,040
See you.

91
00:08:10,910 --> 00:08:15,030
[Eight hours ago]

92
00:08:24,910 --> 00:08:26,350
What took you so long?

93
00:08:29,310 --> 00:08:30,630
Once we reach Pangzhou,

94
00:08:30,630 --> 00:08:31,360
Ruhui,

95
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,630
are you going to do some big business?

96
00:08:33,630 --> 00:08:34,320
No rush.

97
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,549
Once we reach Pangzhou,

98
00:08:35,549 --> 00:08:37,440
I'll first show you around,

99
00:08:37,510 --> 00:08:38,909
find a woman to get rid of the bad luck,

100
00:08:38,909 --> 00:08:40,120
and then get down to business.

101
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,450
There's plenty of time.

102
00:08:41,549 --> 00:08:43,270
Your Tianxiang Sect is amazing.

103
00:08:43,270 --> 00:08:43,909
Ruhui,

104
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:46,030
do you earn a lot of gold bars

105
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:48,030
from every deal?

106
00:08:48,490 --> 00:08:50,080
[Lyu Ruhui, Tianxiang Sect]

107
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,080
Remember,

108
00:08:51,270 --> 00:08:52,790
everyone in the Tianxiang Sect

109
00:08:52,790 --> 00:08:54,000
boasts the talent

110
00:08:54,030 --> 00:08:55,670
of a chancellor.

111
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,840
Do you know

112
00:08:59,030 --> 00:09:00,240
what this is?

113
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:01,720
Only

114
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,670
the Batou

115
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:03,910
can have this.

116
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,840
What is "Batou"?

117
00:09:07,550 --> 00:09:08,600
A leader.

118
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:12,570
Looks like I made the right choice following you!

119
00:09:12,750 --> 00:09:13,960
During the trip to Pangzhou,

120
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:16,070
you must keep your head clear.

121
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,750
When I tell you to strike,

122
00:09:18,150 --> 00:09:19,150
be quick about it.

123
00:09:23,150 --> 00:09:23,870
Ruhui,

124
00:09:24,270 --> 00:09:25,510
didn't you tell me before that

125
00:09:25,510 --> 00:09:27,000
the Tianxiang Sect only tricks people

126
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:27,670
but never kills them?

127
00:09:27,670 --> 00:09:29,630
Rules were set by our ancestors.

128
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:31,150
If we never kill,

129
00:09:31,300 --> 00:09:33,900
the pittance we make is barely enough to get by.

130
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,120
You're right.

131
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:43,960
Chengming,

132
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:45,150
be careful.

133
00:09:46,070 --> 00:09:47,730
It's indeed not enough for me.

134
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:00,150
This is just the beginning.

135
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,580
I won't let a single one

136
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:05,140
of the Tianxiang Sect escape.

137
00:10:45,820 --> 00:10:46,480
[Recorded by Lyu Ruhai]

138
00:10:59,650 --> 00:11:01,800
[Huangsha]

139
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,000
Senior Gui,

140
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:23,080
I've shaved.

141
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:28,240
Just in case you didn't

142
00:11:28,750 --> 00:11:30,010
shave it clean enough,

143
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,680
let me shave it for you again.

144
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,810
Where did you come from?

145
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:38,050
Pujiang.

146
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,520
Which station did you get on the train at?

147
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:40,390
Fanhuangdu Station.

148
00:11:40,390 --> 00:11:42,600
Why are there 2 tickets?

149
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,510
Miss Lyu from Pujiang

150
00:11:48,510 --> 00:11:49,840
insisted on eloping with me.

151
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:51,170
She bought the tickets.

152
00:11:51,180 --> 00:11:52,180
Where is she then?

153
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:54,720
If I brought every girl who wanted

154
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,030
to elope with me,

155
00:11:57,550 --> 00:11:59,550
how could I work for you, Senior Gui?

156
00:12:05,630 --> 00:12:06,750
Listen,

157
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:08,760
I despise you pretty swindlers

158
00:12:08,790 --> 00:12:10,150
the most, you know?

159
00:12:10,150 --> 00:12:11,510
You gigolos

160
00:12:11,750 --> 00:12:12,750
elope with women and swindle them.

161
00:12:12,750 --> 00:12:14,350
What skills do you even have?

162
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,070
Senior Gui,

163
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:19,500
this actually requires some skills.

164
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:25,260
The Philippine cigar—

165
00:12:25,670 --> 00:12:27,070
not as good as Cuban ones.

166
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,720
I'll just make do with it.

167
00:12:53,900 --> 00:12:54,930
Made in Burgundy.

168
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,340
You really spent a lot.

169
00:12:56,790 --> 00:12:57,630
However,

170
00:12:57,630 --> 00:13:00,000
this short, wide glass with a narrow rim is called a cognac glass.

171
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,320
It's meant for brandy.

172
00:13:01,750 --> 00:13:03,410
So it's a bit unconventional.

173
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:06,030
Interesting.

174
00:13:07,910 --> 00:13:09,080
Fine feathers make

175
00:13:09,270 --> 00:13:10,240
fine birds.

176
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:13,030
Go pick an outfit.

177
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,770
There's a phone in the room.

178
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:27,960
Call me

179
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,720
if you need anything.

180
00:13:31,870 --> 00:13:32,600
Senior Gui,

181
00:13:33,530 --> 00:13:35,070
I know you don't like me,

182
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:38,120
but we still have to get along in the future.

183
00:13:38,390 --> 00:13:39,250
How about this?

184
00:13:39,550 --> 00:13:40,910
I'll treat you to dinner.

185
00:13:40,910 --> 00:13:41,790
Let's

186
00:13:42,030 --> 00:13:43,220
bury the hatchet.

187
00:13:44,670 --> 00:13:46,030
Save it.

188
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:48,240
You should use that time

189
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,550
to memorize the stuff.

190
00:13:49,750 --> 00:13:50,270
Also,

191
00:13:50,750 --> 00:13:51,780
you're not leaving here

192
00:13:51,780 --> 00:13:53,030
until you've memorized it properly,

193
00:13:53,030 --> 00:13:53,960
understand?

194
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:54,790
No way.

195
00:13:55,150 --> 00:13:56,510
I've been holding back all the way.

196
00:13:56,510 --> 00:13:58,170
I need to go walk around first.

197
00:13:58,790 --> 00:13:59,510
Brat,

198
00:13:59,790 --> 00:14:00,360
listen.

199
00:14:01,030 --> 00:14:02,320
Don't get too big for your britches,

200
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:03,240
understand?

201
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,670
Gigolos like you are

202
00:14:05,870 --> 00:14:07,870
a dime a dozen in our Tianxiang Sect.

203
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:10,030
If you screw things up,

204
00:14:10,390 --> 00:14:11,630
I'll kill you

205
00:14:11,870 --> 00:14:14,200
before my master even has to give an order.

206
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,790
We don't have much time left.

207
00:14:17,890 --> 00:14:18,120
[Chen Qingying]

208
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:19,520
We've got only one night.

209
00:14:19,710 --> 00:14:21,790
You must memorize every single word

210
00:14:21,790 --> 00:14:22,720
on this.

211
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,940
Whether this plan succeeds or not

212
00:14:25,150 --> 00:14:26,440
all depends on you.

213
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,630
Congratulations, President Chen!

214
00:14:38,630 --> 00:14:39,830
Thank you, thank you.

215
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,960
Thank you all for coming to show your support.

216
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:43,510
Thank you, thank you so much.

217
00:14:43,510 --> 00:14:44,670
President Chen!

218
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:47,080
Director Zhao!

219
00:14:48,210 --> 00:14:49,180
President Chen.

220
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,480
Congratulations

221
00:14:50,910 --> 00:14:52,550
on opening your new store!

222
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,080
I'm just running a small business.

223
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:56,610
I'll still need your support, Director Zhao.

224
00:14:57,670 --> 00:14:59,270
If yours is a small business,

225
00:14:59,510 --> 00:15:02,510
then no one in Pangzhou City would dare to do business.

226
00:15:04,270 --> 00:15:05,330
Where is Qingying?

227
00:15:07,150 --> 00:15:08,870
She was here just now.

228
00:15:29,110 --> 00:15:29,780
[Chen's Gold Shop]

229
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,820
Congratulations, Daddy.

230
00:15:46,510 --> 00:15:47,270
Qingying!

231
00:15:47,270 --> 00:15:48,120
Hi, Mr. Zhao.

232
00:15:51,750 --> 00:15:52,790
I'll talk to you later, Mr. Zhao.

233
00:15:52,790 --> 00:15:53,320
Okay.

234
00:16:14,870 --> 00:16:16,200
Daddy.

235
00:16:17,530 --> 00:16:19,840
Get changed and throw this suit away right now.

236
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:21,240
A female university graduate

237
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:22,790
from Cambridge hangs out

238
00:16:22,790 --> 00:16:24,840
with these low-class people every day.

239
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:25,970
How inappropriate!

240
00:16:27,340 --> 00:16:29,820
Stop talking about upper class and lower class all the time.

241
00:16:29,820 --> 00:16:31,180
Abraham Lincoln said,

242
00:16:31,370 --> 00:16:32,970
"All men are created equal."

243
00:16:34,010 --> 00:16:36,660
If you were a boy, I wouldn't even bother with you.

244
00:16:36,660 --> 00:16:38,930
But you are my only daughter.

245
00:16:39,090 --> 00:16:39,960
If you keep this up,

246
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,620
who's ever going to marry you?

247
00:16:43,510 --> 00:16:44,360
Daddy,

248
00:16:44,750 --> 00:16:46,750
do you really want me to get married?

249
00:16:47,490 --> 00:16:49,080
What nonsense are you talking about?

250
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:49,840
A grown-up girl

251
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:51,460
has to get married, of course.

252
00:16:51,460 --> 00:16:52,670
If I get married,

253
00:16:52,990 --> 00:16:54,300
our gold shops,

254
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:55,390
pawnshops,

255
00:16:56,010 --> 00:16:56,790
and restaurants

256
00:16:56,790 --> 00:16:58,590
will all belong to someone else.

257
00:16:59,350 --> 00:17:01,740
That's why I can only take in a live-in son-in-law,

258
00:17:01,740 --> 00:17:04,670
and every son you have must take the Chen family name!

259
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:06,680
Okay!

260
00:17:07,150 --> 00:17:09,010
I'll go find one for you right now.

261
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:11,619
Where are you going?

262
00:17:11,619 --> 00:17:12,480
Come back here!

263
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:14,240
I'm going to return the suit.

264
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:22,880
Mr. Lin,

265
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:24,640
here is the newspaper you ordered.

266
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:25,310
Thank you.

267
00:17:32,070 --> 00:17:34,590
[Lin Shengxiang arrived in Suicheng yesterday.]

268
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,000
Okay, I got it.

269
00:17:40,310 --> 00:17:40,680
Okay.

270
00:17:41,790 --> 00:17:42,400
That's it.

271
00:17:43,870 --> 00:17:44,330
Master.

272
00:17:47,790 --> 00:17:48,590
What's wrong?

273
00:17:50,030 --> 00:17:51,110
I mean, look at you.

274
00:17:52,350 --> 00:17:54,410
Why are your looks so disappointing?

275
00:17:54,830 --> 00:17:56,550
If you were even a bit decent-looking,

276
00:17:56,550 --> 00:17:59,480
I wouldn't have had to get someone here from Pujiang.

277
00:17:59,510 --> 00:18:00,270
Thankfully,

278
00:18:01,030 --> 00:18:02,590
he looks quite quick-witted.

279
00:18:02,590 --> 00:18:04,720
Well, it's not my fault how I look.

280
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:06,200
Then whose fault is it?

281
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:08,750
Why didn't you take after your mother?

282
00:18:09,030 --> 00:18:09,750
Fine, fine.

283
00:18:10,320 --> 00:18:11,910
Just blame it on my disappointing looks.

284
00:18:11,910 --> 00:18:13,300
You said he's quick-witted.

285
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:14,430
But I don't think so.

286
00:18:14,550 --> 00:18:15,480
I think this brat

287
00:18:16,230 --> 00:18:17,030
is a bit fishy.

288
00:18:17,550 --> 00:18:19,350
He gave all the right passwords.

289
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:21,160
The token is also real.

290
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:23,880
But I still can't feel at ease.

291
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:25,060
How about this?

292
00:18:25,270 --> 00:18:26,670
I'll send them a telegram

293
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:28,210
to confirm, just to be safe.

294
00:18:28,510 --> 00:18:29,310
Don't bother.

295
00:18:30,510 --> 00:18:31,830
After we wrap up this job,

296
00:18:31,830 --> 00:18:32,750
he'll be gone.

297
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:35,310
Gone?

298
00:18:35,970 --> 00:18:37,720
Isn't he your junior's disciple?

299
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:39,400
Your looks are disappointing,

300
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:41,440
so is your brain.

301
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,750
"Different branches, different ties."

302
00:18:43,750 --> 00:18:45,610
Haven't you heard of this saying?

303
00:18:45,910 --> 00:18:49,240
Isn't it good to have one less person to share the money with?

304
00:18:50,830 --> 00:18:51,590
Master,

305
00:18:51,590 --> 00:18:52,400
you are really wicked.

306
00:18:52,400 --> 00:18:53,200
Master Hu.

307
00:18:54,480 --> 00:18:55,200
Long time no see.

308
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:55,920
Long time no see,

309
00:18:55,920 --> 00:18:56,640
Mr. Lin.

310
00:18:56,850 --> 00:18:58,050
Welcome to Pangzhou.

311
00:18:59,690 --> 00:19:00,110
Alright,

312
00:19:00,110 --> 00:19:01,200
everything is ready.

313
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:02,330
Go with your senior.

314
00:19:02,550 --> 00:19:02,920
Okay.

315
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:03,770
Let's go.

316
00:19:08,460 --> 00:19:10,060
What's wrong with your eyes?

317
00:19:12,510 --> 00:19:13,770
Keep a close eye on him!

318
00:19:18,070 --> 00:19:19,880
What did I do to deserve this?

319
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:30,010
Every Wednesday night,

320
00:19:30,140 --> 00:19:31,940
Miss Chen comes to this bar

321
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:35,600
and orders a special brandy as well as a portion of fried fish,

322
00:19:36,070 --> 00:19:37,510
because her favorite band

323
00:19:37,510 --> 00:19:39,000
only performs on Wednesday nights.

324
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:41,350
The band finishes their performance at 9 PM.

325
00:19:41,350 --> 00:19:43,350
Miss Chen always comes secretly

326
00:19:43,510 --> 00:19:44,790
behind her father's back.

327
00:19:44,790 --> 00:19:46,570
She comes and goes by a rickshaw.

328
00:19:46,570 --> 00:19:48,460
From here to her house,

329
00:19:48,480 --> 00:19:50,480
she has to pass through 3 blocks.

330
00:19:50,510 --> 00:19:53,000
Our men will lie in ambush on Shamo Street in advance

331
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:54,790
and act immediately once we spot her.

332
00:19:54,790 --> 00:19:56,050
Your mission this time

333
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:57,960
is to rescue Chen Qingying

334
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:59,920
from our men.

335
00:20:00,310 --> 00:20:01,310
You'll be doing great.

336
00:20:01,310 --> 00:20:03,070
As the son of a rich businessman in San Francisco

337
00:20:03,070 --> 00:20:04,790
and her savior,

338
00:20:06,640 --> 00:20:07,810
you can take

339
00:20:07,830 --> 00:20:09,240
this first step easily.

340
00:20:09,350 --> 00:20:09,810
Come on.

341
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:11,650
Saving the damsel in distress—

342
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:12,400
how cliché.

343
00:20:12,910 --> 00:20:13,840
What do you mean?

344
00:20:13,870 --> 00:20:15,000
Just say your lines!

345
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:29,090
Where are you going?

346
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:39,110
Hello.

347
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:49,160
Someone hired me for 100 silver dollars a day

348
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:50,420
to make you fall for me.

349
00:20:51,590 --> 00:20:52,680
This opening line

350
00:20:52,860 --> 00:20:53,820
is new to me.

351
00:20:54,030 --> 00:20:54,630
It's real.

352
00:20:55,120 --> 00:20:55,630
And

353
00:20:55,790 --> 00:20:56,590
I took the job.

354
00:20:57,780 --> 00:20:58,430
Miss Chen,

355
00:20:59,550 --> 00:21:00,480
do you need help?

356
00:21:04,020 --> 00:21:05,250
One special brandy

357
00:21:05,540 --> 00:21:06,300
and one fried fish.

358
00:21:06,300 --> 00:21:06,610
Okay.

359
00:21:06,610 --> 00:21:07,410
Two brandies.

360
00:21:11,070 --> 00:21:11,870
Just a moment.

361
00:21:15,400 --> 00:21:17,000
So how do you plan to court me?

362
00:21:18,110 --> 00:21:18,840
I don't know.

363
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:19,920
We could

364
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:21,110
first go shopping,

365
00:21:21,110 --> 00:21:21,750
see an opera,

366
00:21:21,750 --> 00:21:22,440
watch a movie,

367
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:23,160
and then

368
00:21:23,510 --> 00:21:24,430
meet your parents.

369
00:21:24,430 --> 00:21:25,360
That's too slow.

370
00:21:25,500 --> 00:21:26,840
Why not just meet my parents directly?

371
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:27,580
That works, too.

372
00:21:27,580 --> 00:21:29,170
My family has a lot of rules.

373
00:21:29,450 --> 00:21:30,480
You can only be my matrilocal husband.

374
00:21:30,480 --> 00:21:31,140
No problem.

375
00:21:31,300 --> 00:21:32,690
We can have 2 children.

376
00:21:32,850 --> 00:21:33,720
The first one takes your surname,

377
00:21:33,720 --> 00:21:34,540
and the second one takes mine.

378
00:21:34,540 --> 00:21:35,300
No way.

379
00:21:36,350 --> 00:21:38,080
They must both take my surname.

380
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:41,580
I suppose I can live with that.

381
00:21:43,330 --> 00:21:44,860
You're quite interesting.

382
00:21:45,980 --> 00:21:47,910
If I had asked you to leave just now,

383
00:21:48,110 --> 00:21:50,910
you wouldn't have had the chance to say these, huh?

384
00:21:51,830 --> 00:21:53,290
I would've had the chance.

385
00:21:53,650 --> 00:21:55,820
We'd hire a few men to ambush you on the way.

386
00:21:55,820 --> 00:21:57,400
Once they get you under control,

387
00:21:57,400 --> 00:21:58,440
I'd swoop in

388
00:21:58,720 --> 00:22:00,480
and take them all down.

389
00:22:00,750 --> 00:22:01,440
After that,

390
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:02,480
you'd believe

391
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:03,540
whatever I say.

392
00:22:05,030 --> 00:22:06,760
Saving the damsel in distress?

393
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,110
What a cliché.

394
00:22:09,960 --> 00:22:11,160
It is a bit of a cliché.

395
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:12,640
However,

396
00:22:14,270 --> 00:22:16,640
there are always some fools who will buy it.

397
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:17,920
Let me tell you a story.

398
00:22:23,310 --> 00:22:25,590
Listen, you need to understand your father.

399
00:22:25,590 --> 00:22:26,590
He's getting old.

400
00:22:26,590 --> 00:22:28,400
Of course, he wants you to inherit the family business,

401
00:22:28,400 --> 00:22:28,960
right?

402
00:22:29,110 --> 00:22:31,550
I studied architecture abroad, not business.

403
00:22:31,550 --> 00:22:33,590
I've always looked up to Mr. Liang as my role model.

404
00:22:33,590 --> 00:22:34,550
Chinese learning as the base,

405
00:22:34,550 --> 00:22:35,910
Western learning for application.

406
00:22:35,910 --> 00:22:36,810
I hope my life...

407
00:22:36,810 --> 00:22:37,410
Yes,

408
00:22:37,590 --> 00:22:39,030
you studied abroad and returned

409
00:22:39,030 --> 00:22:40,350
with a degree in architecture.

410
00:22:40,350 --> 00:22:40,750
Right?

411
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:41,880
This and inheriting

412
00:22:41,880 --> 00:22:43,400
your family's silk business

413
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:44,440
don't conflict at all.

414
00:22:44,440 --> 00:22:45,640
They don't conflict? How?

415
00:22:45,640 --> 00:22:46,880
Do you know how many people

416
00:22:46,880 --> 00:22:48,740
envy you for having such a father?

417
00:22:53,550 --> 00:22:56,000
-Bravo! -Bravo!

418
00:22:56,880 --> 00:23:20,920
♪ There is a fiery woman in the brothel ♪

419
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:23,720
-Nice! -Bravo!

420
00:23:28,750 --> 00:23:29,310
Sir.

421
00:23:32,030 --> 00:23:33,200
Did you get someone else

422
00:23:33,200 --> 00:23:34,310
to play Liang Hongyu?

423
00:23:34,310 --> 00:23:34,790
Yes.

424
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:36,590
The previous one's voice changed.

425
00:23:36,590 --> 00:23:37,310
This is the new performer.

426
00:23:37,310 --> 00:23:37,920
♪ She sees one man off only to welcome another every day ♪

427
00:23:37,920 --> 00:23:39,030
Her stage name is Feiyan.

428
00:23:39,030 --> 00:23:41,290
Her figure and voice are both excellent.

429
00:23:41,310 --> 00:23:43,270
The manager let her fill in for a couple of shows.

430
00:23:43,270 --> 00:23:44,530
When this show is over,

431
00:23:45,550 --> 00:23:47,590
send 2 flower baskets to the backstage for me.

432
00:23:47,590 --> 00:23:48,850
Don't mention my name.

433
00:23:49,110 --> 00:23:49,680
Got it.

434
00:23:50,030 --> 00:23:51,290
Please enjoy it, sirs.

435
00:23:54,070 --> 00:23:57,160
-Bravo! -Bravo!

436
00:24:01,270 --> 00:24:01,920
Go back!

437
00:24:01,920 --> 00:24:03,030
What do you want?

438
00:24:03,110 --> 00:24:03,640
Help!

439
00:24:03,640 --> 00:24:05,400
We are a bit cash-strapped.

440
00:24:05,400 --> 00:24:07,240
We just want to borrow some money from you.

441
00:24:07,240 --> 00:24:08,310
If you don't have any,

442
00:24:08,310 --> 00:24:10,030
then we'll borrow something else.

443
00:24:10,030 --> 00:24:11,360
What are you doing here?

444
00:24:13,920 --> 00:24:15,270
It's none of your business.

445
00:24:15,270 --> 00:24:15,880
Get lost!

446
00:24:20,110 --> 00:24:22,510
Aren't you the one who played Liang Hongyu?

447
00:24:24,690 --> 00:24:26,340
If she is "Liang Hongyu,"

448
00:24:26,890 --> 00:24:28,820
then you must be "Han Shizhong."

449
00:24:30,150 --> 00:24:32,350
You want to marry this bitch

450
00:24:32,740 --> 00:24:34,940
and let her sing for you in bed every day,

451
00:24:34,960 --> 00:24:35,550
right?

452
00:24:36,750 --> 00:24:37,750
What a pity.

453
00:24:39,240 --> 00:24:40,640
Before the wedding,

454
00:24:41,180 --> 00:24:43,240
I have to hold a funeral for you first.

455
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:43,960
Boss,

456
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:44,920
boss,

457
00:24:45,540 --> 00:24:47,540
we are all making a living.

458
00:24:47,680 --> 00:24:48,880
Sorry for the offense.

459
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:50,030
Run! Run quickly!

460
00:24:56,880 --> 00:24:57,610
Are you okay?

461
00:25:00,400 --> 00:25:01,240
This is fake.

462
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:04,060
A toy I bought for my younger brother.

463
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:05,720
Then please

464
00:25:06,070 --> 00:25:06,880
put it away.

465
00:25:08,480 --> 00:25:09,080
By the way,

466
00:25:09,820 --> 00:25:11,820
did you receive the flower baskets?

467
00:25:12,960 --> 00:25:13,640
I sent them.

468
00:25:21,110 --> 00:25:22,510
So were those hooligans

469
00:25:22,750 --> 00:25:24,150
really hired by that man?

470
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:25,680
Maybe they were

471
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:27,310
hired by that woman.

472
00:25:28,750 --> 00:25:29,890
A woman

473
00:25:29,920 --> 00:25:31,550
had someone harass her.

474
00:25:32,220 --> 00:25:34,550
What if the man didn't show up and save her?

475
00:25:34,590 --> 00:25:36,190
Wouldn't she end up in a bind?

476
00:25:36,410 --> 00:25:37,450
If this woman had

477
00:25:37,770 --> 00:25:40,350
investigated this man thoroughly beforehand,

478
00:25:40,350 --> 00:25:41,960
there would've been no "what if."

479
00:25:41,960 --> 00:25:43,090
What happened next?

480
00:25:43,600 --> 00:25:44,280
Next...

481
00:25:49,240 --> 00:25:50,170
Happy birthday.

482
00:25:53,400 --> 00:25:53,920
You...

483
00:25:55,590 --> 00:25:57,190
How did you know my birthday?

484
00:25:57,350 --> 00:25:58,830
I have my ways.

485
00:26:02,350 --> 00:26:03,350
This is

486
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:04,900
the first time someone

487
00:26:05,640 --> 00:26:07,370
made longevity noodles for me.

488
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:09,700
Because no one has ever

489
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:12,880
celebrated my birthday since I was little.

490
00:26:14,070 --> 00:26:14,830
Thank you.

491
00:26:16,350 --> 00:26:18,210
My father died an untimely death.

492
00:26:18,350 --> 00:26:19,680
I grew up with my mother.

493
00:26:20,830 --> 00:26:21,830
My mother has been

494
00:26:22,750 --> 00:26:24,150
seriously ill for years.

495
00:26:24,720 --> 00:26:27,270
We've seen many doctors, but none could cure her.

496
00:26:27,270 --> 00:26:28,030
Therefore,

497
00:26:28,880 --> 00:26:31,000
no one could spare a thought for things like this.

498
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:33,000
What illness does your mother have?

499
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:35,680
Some of my classmates study Western medicine.

500
00:26:35,680 --> 00:26:37,510
I can have them consult on her case.

501
00:26:37,510 --> 00:26:38,640
It won't help.

502
00:26:39,680 --> 00:26:40,550
I once

503
00:26:41,070 --> 00:26:43,200
ran into an old gentleman surnamed Du.

504
00:26:43,680 --> 00:26:44,640
He told me that

505
00:26:45,640 --> 00:26:46,790
my mother fell ill

506
00:26:47,480 --> 00:26:48,590
all because of me,

507
00:26:49,350 --> 00:26:51,680
and I was a born jinx, bringing misfortune

508
00:26:51,790 --> 00:26:53,750
to my parents, relatives, friends,

509
00:26:53,750 --> 00:26:54,950
and my devoted lover.

510
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:56,520
In a nutshell,

511
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:58,250
everyone who treats me well

512
00:26:58,720 --> 00:26:59,550
will end up

513
00:27:00,030 --> 00:27:01,200
dead because of me.

514
00:27:01,570 --> 00:27:02,880
That's utter nonsense.

515
00:27:02,880 --> 00:27:03,750
It's all true.

516
00:27:04,140 --> 00:27:04,820
Moreover,

517
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:06,550
Mr. Du also told me that

518
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:09,460
the only way to get rid of this bad luck

519
00:27:10,480 --> 00:27:12,280
was to remain unmarried for life

520
00:27:12,400 --> 00:27:14,400
and work in the lowest professions—

521
00:27:14,640 --> 00:27:16,640
I should either be a lowly performer

522
00:27:17,480 --> 00:27:18,160
or...

523
00:27:20,510 --> 00:27:21,550
Or be a whore.

524
00:27:21,720 --> 00:27:22,920
Where is that old guy?

525
00:27:23,480 --> 00:27:24,940
I'll go find him right now!

526
00:27:24,960 --> 00:27:26,960
Mr. Du wanders all over the country.

527
00:27:27,110 --> 00:27:28,170
You can't find him.

528
00:27:28,720 --> 00:27:29,550
But

529
00:27:29,750 --> 00:27:31,310
since I started trying this method,

530
00:27:31,310 --> 00:27:32,510
my mother's indeed been

531
00:27:32,510 --> 00:27:34,030
taking a turn for the better.

532
00:27:34,030 --> 00:27:34,920
So this really works.

533
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:35,980
Don't believe him.

534
00:27:36,310 --> 00:27:38,200
These fortune tellers all talk nonsense.

535
00:27:38,200 --> 00:27:39,880
Why should performers who play miserable people

536
00:27:39,880 --> 00:27:41,440
be considered the lowliest?

537
00:27:41,440 --> 00:27:42,070
I actually think

538
00:27:42,070 --> 00:27:43,600
they've got real backbone.

539
00:27:44,310 --> 00:27:44,720
Well,

540
00:27:45,360 --> 00:27:46,620
take me to your mother,

541
00:27:47,260 --> 00:27:49,060
and I'll take her to see a doctor.

542
00:27:49,200 --> 00:27:50,060
How about that?

543
00:27:54,070 --> 00:27:55,400
It's all superstition.

544
00:27:56,110 --> 00:27:57,680
Birth, aging, illness, and death

545
00:27:57,680 --> 00:27:59,400
are part of the natural order.

546
00:27:59,830 --> 00:28:02,790
Those who describe a pretty woman as the source of disaster

547
00:28:02,790 --> 00:28:03,720
are mostly

548
00:28:03,750 --> 00:28:05,750
miserable and pathetic themselves

549
00:28:05,750 --> 00:28:07,680
and can't stand seeing others do well.

550
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:08,750
Everyone

551
00:28:09,160 --> 00:28:10,890
has something they believe in.

552
00:28:11,350 --> 00:28:12,960
It could be gods or Buddhas,

553
00:28:13,640 --> 00:28:15,880
money or power.

554
00:28:16,960 --> 00:28:17,820
What about you?

555
00:28:18,510 --> 00:28:19,510
What do you believe in?

556
00:28:19,510 --> 00:28:20,640
I believe in myself.

557
00:28:23,380 --> 00:28:24,110
That's nice.

558
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:26,750
So, were those two people

559
00:28:26,750 --> 00:28:28,210
going to fall in love next?

560
00:28:30,960 --> 00:28:32,020
It's getting late.

561
00:28:32,640 --> 00:28:34,840
Your parents must be worried about you.

562
00:28:36,790 --> 00:28:37,850
It's this late now?

563
00:28:40,480 --> 00:28:43,540
I got so caught up in your story that I lost track of time.

564
00:28:43,680 --> 00:28:44,940
Let me escort you home.

565
00:28:45,590 --> 00:28:46,390
Don't bother.

566
00:29:03,030 --> 00:29:03,880
My lady.

567
00:29:07,200 --> 00:29:09,060
You're quite a good storyteller.

568
00:29:09,110 --> 00:29:11,240
I'll tell you more if there's a chance.

569
00:29:27,790 --> 00:29:29,640
You came back so late again.

570
00:29:30,200 --> 00:29:31,920
As a young lady,

571
00:29:32,030 --> 00:29:33,510
you go to bars every night

572
00:29:33,510 --> 00:29:34,710
and come back so late.

573
00:29:35,120 --> 00:29:36,280
If anything happens to you,

574
00:29:36,280 --> 00:29:38,210
how will you ever get married then?

575
00:29:39,320 --> 00:29:40,670
Come on.

576
00:29:41,640 --> 00:29:43,500
What could possibly happen to me?

577
00:29:44,140 --> 00:29:45,790
You reek of alcohol!

578
00:29:46,100 --> 00:29:48,100
Who were you drinking with tonight?

579
00:29:49,550 --> 00:29:50,080
With him.

580
00:29:55,880 --> 00:29:59,810
Lin Shengxiang, the son of a leader in the overseas Chinese community?

581
00:30:04,990 --> 00:30:07,250
I can stab you to death. Do you believe it?

582
00:30:07,250 --> 00:30:07,930
Master,

583
00:30:07,960 --> 00:30:09,790
you told me to keep a close eye on him.

584
00:30:09,790 --> 00:30:11,310
I watched him like a hawk.

585
00:30:11,570 --> 00:30:12,700
But this bastard

586
00:30:12,720 --> 00:30:14,580
didn't stick to the script at all!

587
00:30:15,110 --> 00:30:16,440
Ouch! It Hurts!

588
00:30:18,400 --> 00:30:19,030
Gui.

589
00:30:19,680 --> 00:30:21,070
Having you around

590
00:30:21,200 --> 00:30:23,110
will take years off my life.

591
00:30:24,220 --> 00:30:24,570
What?

592
00:30:27,720 --> 00:30:28,400
Answer me.

593
00:30:29,100 --> 00:30:30,750
Why did you act on your own?

594
00:30:31,270 --> 00:30:33,130
If I had done what you told me to do,

595
00:30:33,310 --> 00:30:34,630
the whole plan would be screwed up.

596
00:30:34,630 --> 00:30:35,410
Do you really think

597
00:30:35,410 --> 00:30:37,550
a rich heiress wouldn't have bodyguards with her

598
00:30:37,550 --> 00:30:39,210
when she goes to a bar at night?

599
00:30:40,550 --> 00:30:41,950
Do you know her that well?

600
00:30:42,310 --> 00:30:44,750
I sleep with that book in my arms every night!

601
00:30:44,750 --> 00:30:46,480
No one knows her better than me!

602
00:30:50,590 --> 00:30:52,240
Let go.

603
00:30:54,750 --> 00:30:55,400
Get up.

604
00:30:59,170 --> 00:31:00,130
This brat

605
00:31:00,790 --> 00:31:02,790
simply got dumb luck.

606
00:31:03,470 --> 00:31:04,470
He has no brains.

607
00:31:04,610 --> 00:31:06,420
That woman is even crazier than him!

608
00:31:06,420 --> 00:31:08,750
He has more brains than you.

609
00:31:08,970 --> 00:31:10,860
Since the very first day you started working for me,

610
00:31:10,860 --> 00:31:12,140
I've told you

611
00:31:12,170 --> 00:31:14,780
to strike fast and con patiently.

612
00:31:14,960 --> 00:31:16,820
He hit the mark in the first place.

613
00:31:17,090 --> 00:31:19,200
No matter how he cons Chen Qingying afterwards,

614
00:31:19,200 --> 00:31:20,960
she won't suspect him anymore.

615
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:26,110
Kid,

616
00:31:26,620 --> 00:31:27,880
you did well this time.

617
00:31:27,950 --> 00:31:28,580
However,

618
00:31:28,750 --> 00:31:29,920
if you dare to act

619
00:31:30,310 --> 00:31:31,950
without permission again,

620
00:31:32,470 --> 00:31:33,920
I'll skin you alive.

621
00:31:37,000 --> 00:31:37,640
Master,

622
00:31:37,790 --> 00:31:39,270
our plan is already ruined now.

623
00:31:39,270 --> 00:31:40,440
What should we do next?

624
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:41,590
You can't set up a chance encounter

625
00:31:41,590 --> 00:31:42,850
for them again, right?

626
00:31:43,510 --> 00:31:44,840
Don't worry about that.

627
00:31:45,920 --> 00:31:46,750
She will

628
00:31:49,030 --> 00:31:50,830
definitely contact me in 3 days.

629
00:32:17,440 --> 00:32:18,110
Coming.

630
00:32:20,030 --> 00:32:20,640
Hi.

631
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:22,590
Miss Chen?

632
00:32:25,790 --> 00:32:26,990
What brings you here?

633
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:28,240
What?

634
00:32:28,790 --> 00:32:29,990
Am I not welcome here?

635
00:32:30,310 --> 00:32:31,920
Coming to see me so openly, aren't you afraid

636
00:32:31,920 --> 00:32:33,050
someone will see us?

637
00:32:33,400 --> 00:32:34,260
Are you afraid?

638
00:32:34,270 --> 00:32:35,160
Why would I be?

639
00:32:35,890 --> 00:32:38,020
I'm hired for 100 silver dollars a day.

640
00:32:38,130 --> 00:32:38,990
How about this?

641
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:41,570
Give me half your remuneration,

642
00:32:41,930 --> 00:32:43,240
and I promise I won't tell anyone.

643
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:44,400
You can have it all.

644
00:32:45,260 --> 00:32:45,850
What's the plan?

645
00:32:45,850 --> 00:32:48,560
Are we going shopping or going to the opera today?

646
00:32:48,560 --> 00:32:49,560
Didn't I tell you?

647
00:32:49,820 --> 00:32:52,070
We're going to meet my parents directly.

648
00:32:52,070 --> 00:32:52,600
Let's go.

649
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:54,000
Come home with me.

650
00:32:57,510 --> 00:32:58,100
Mr. Lin,

651
00:32:58,510 --> 00:33:01,510
is our food to your liking?

652
00:33:02,070 --> 00:33:03,130
Hometown food made

653
00:33:03,270 --> 00:33:04,940
in your hometown tastes the best.

654
00:33:04,940 --> 00:33:06,790
I couldn't get the same flavor where I used to live.

655
00:33:06,790 --> 00:33:09,190
It always felt like something was missing.

656
00:33:10,340 --> 00:33:11,880
Qingying felt the same as you.

657
00:33:11,880 --> 00:33:14,110
Back when she was studying in England,

658
00:33:14,450 --> 00:33:16,800
she always missed our homemade food

659
00:33:16,820 --> 00:33:18,080
and craved this taste.

660
00:33:20,880 --> 00:33:21,550
Mr. Lin,

661
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:24,880
which school did you attend in America?

662
00:33:27,180 --> 00:33:27,820
MIT.

663
00:33:28,310 --> 00:33:29,000
Pardon?

664
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:32,470
MIT.

665
00:33:33,780 --> 00:33:34,730
That's a good school.

666
00:33:34,730 --> 00:33:35,840
Pretty good.

667
00:33:37,070 --> 00:33:39,630
What are you planning to do this time you're back?

668
00:33:39,630 --> 00:33:40,830
To be honest with you,

669
00:33:40,960 --> 00:33:42,620
I'm planning to buy a tin mine.

670
00:33:43,270 --> 00:33:43,930
For mining?

671
00:33:45,860 --> 00:33:47,460
The mining business is

672
00:33:47,740 --> 00:33:48,940
pretty complicated.

673
00:33:49,650 --> 00:33:50,890
You are new here.

674
00:33:50,980 --> 00:33:52,000
If you run into any difficulties,

675
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:53,520
just feel free to tell me.

676
00:33:53,550 --> 00:33:55,480
I will do whatever I can to help you.

677
00:33:56,070 --> 00:33:56,930
Thank you, sir.

678
00:33:57,370 --> 00:33:58,890
But my father told me

679
00:33:59,310 --> 00:34:00,510
to find

680
00:34:00,540 --> 00:34:02,070
a remarkable feng shui master—

681
00:34:02,070 --> 00:34:02,720
Mr. Song,

682
00:34:03,010 --> 00:34:04,250
Song Tiezui—

683
00:34:04,550 --> 00:34:06,810
and follow his advice on buying the mine.

684
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:08,670
I've never heard of the need for a master

685
00:34:08,670 --> 00:34:10,330
when it comes to buying a mine.

686
00:34:10,710 --> 00:34:11,360
Yeah,

687
00:34:11,360 --> 00:34:12,090
Shengxiang.

688
00:34:12,320 --> 00:34:14,050
As one of the young generation,

689
00:34:14,090 --> 00:34:16,730
do you also believe in feng shui?

690
00:34:20,030 --> 00:34:21,190
My father said that

691
00:34:22,150 --> 00:34:23,760
he asked this master

692
00:34:24,150 --> 00:34:25,210
to change his fate,

693
00:34:26,920 --> 00:34:29,580
and that was how he came to have today's fortune.

694
00:34:31,460 --> 00:34:33,250
"Song Tiezui"?

695
00:34:34,960 --> 00:34:36,960
How come I've never heard

696
00:34:37,320 --> 00:34:39,480
of such a person in Pangzhou before?

697
00:34:39,710 --> 00:34:40,760
Mr. Song is

698
00:34:40,830 --> 00:34:42,139
incredibly elusive.

699
00:34:42,230 --> 00:34:44,550
I only came here because I heard he showed up

700
00:34:44,550 --> 00:34:45,440
in Pangzhou.

701
00:34:47,590 --> 00:34:48,480
Good.

702
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:50,400
By the way,

703
00:34:50,710 --> 00:34:51,440
Shengxiang,

704
00:34:51,670 --> 00:34:53,400
just let Qingying show you

705
00:34:53,420 --> 00:34:56,170
around Pangzhou for the next couple of days.

706
00:34:56,440 --> 00:34:58,110
All the prominent figures here

707
00:34:58,110 --> 00:34:59,440
are my friends.

708
00:34:59,440 --> 00:35:02,100
If you have any questions, feel free to ask them.

709
00:35:04,200 --> 00:35:05,950
Then I'll take you up on that, sir.

710
00:35:05,950 --> 00:35:06,430
Good.

711
00:35:13,180 --> 00:35:13,780
Come on.

712
00:35:13,970 --> 00:35:14,670
Let's eat up.

713
00:35:14,670 --> 00:35:15,070
Okay.

714
00:35:15,920 --> 00:35:16,710
Your mother?

715
00:35:17,230 --> 00:35:18,960
I just said that in the heat of the moment.

716
00:35:18,960 --> 00:35:20,010
Chen Jiarong asked me

717
00:35:20,010 --> 00:35:22,030
why I came to Pangzhou alone without anyone to look after me.

718
00:35:22,030 --> 00:35:22,360
I...

719
00:35:22,420 --> 00:35:23,790
I just blurted out without thinking

720
00:35:23,790 --> 00:35:25,250
that my mom was coming tomorrow.

721
00:35:25,250 --> 00:35:26,760
Never thought that Miss Chen

722
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:27,670
would offer to play host

723
00:35:27,670 --> 00:35:29,280
and hold a banquet for us on behalf of the Chens.

724
00:35:29,280 --> 00:35:30,480
I was afraid that if I refused,

725
00:35:30,480 --> 00:35:32,190
she and her father would get suspicious.

726
00:35:32,190 --> 00:35:32,750
Wait,

727
00:35:33,000 --> 00:35:33,880
tomorrow?

728
00:35:34,030 --> 00:35:35,000
Where do you expect me

729
00:35:35,000 --> 00:35:37,130
to find one for you in such a short time?

730
00:35:37,310 --> 00:35:39,190
Master Hu, as omnipotent as you are,

731
00:35:39,190 --> 00:35:41,320
it shouldn't be too hard for you to find

732
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:42,760
an old lady to put on a show with me, right?

733
00:35:42,760 --> 00:35:44,690
Alright, enough, stop massaging.

734
00:35:47,190 --> 00:35:48,150
This is the first

735
00:35:48,880 --> 00:35:50,340
and last time I'll do this.

736
00:35:50,970 --> 00:35:52,410
Let's get this straight first.

737
00:35:52,410 --> 00:35:54,240
It costs money to find someone to do it.

738
00:35:54,240 --> 00:35:56,190
The expense will come out of your pay.

739
00:35:56,190 --> 00:35:56,960
As it should!

740
00:35:57,590 --> 00:35:59,390
Your mother is coming tomorrow?

741
00:35:59,450 --> 00:36:00,800
Why are you only telling me now?

742
00:36:00,800 --> 00:36:02,230
She was traveling in Pujiang

743
00:36:02,230 --> 00:36:03,840
and suddenly asked to visit me.

744
00:36:03,840 --> 00:36:04,840
Probably because

745
00:36:05,030 --> 00:36:06,440
she was bored being alone.

746
00:36:06,440 --> 00:36:07,570
That's a good thing.

747
00:36:07,850 --> 00:36:08,990
Since you're in Pangzhou,

748
00:36:08,990 --> 00:36:10,590
I'll make the arrangements.

749
00:36:10,760 --> 00:36:11,420
How about we

750
00:36:11,580 --> 00:36:13,360
invite your mother for dinner tomorrow?

751
00:36:13,360 --> 00:36:13,920
Okay.

752
00:36:14,590 --> 00:36:15,590
See you tomorrow.

753
00:36:15,630 --> 00:36:16,630
See you tomorrow.

754
00:36:24,360 --> 00:36:26,620
We're already shorthanded in Pangzhou,

755
00:36:26,630 --> 00:36:28,290
and he needs this so urgently.

756
00:36:28,660 --> 00:36:30,110
Good thing the old madam hasn't left.

757
00:36:30,110 --> 00:36:32,110
We can have her fill in temporarily.

758
00:36:32,150 --> 00:36:33,230
This Lyu Ruhui

759
00:36:33,440 --> 00:36:34,700
keeps messing around.

760
00:36:35,070 --> 00:36:36,360
After we wrap up this job,

761
00:36:36,360 --> 00:36:38,000
let's get rid of him immediately

762
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:39,730
in case he causes more trouble.

763
00:36:52,350 --> 00:36:56,260
♪ Han Shizhong ♪

764
00:36:57,280 --> 00:37:01,770
♪ Fell from power ♪

765
00:37:03,960 --> 00:37:11,270
♪ with his ambition unfulfilled ♪

766
00:37:18,130 --> 00:37:20,320
♪ He ran into... ♪

767
00:37:21,190 --> 00:37:24,190
You must be the young man recommended by Hu Guangyuan.

768
00:37:24,510 --> 00:37:26,240
Have you memorized your lines?

769
00:37:26,610 --> 00:37:27,730
Don't get cold feet

770
00:37:27,750 --> 00:37:28,840
at the last minute

771
00:37:28,840 --> 00:37:30,230
and ruin the show.

772
00:37:41,070 --> 00:37:42,400
It's been so many years.

773
00:37:43,150 --> 00:37:44,320
I missed you so much.

774
00:37:48,590 --> 00:37:49,290
Mother.

775
00:38:00,930 --> 00:38:04,430
[Old Madam Zhu, Tianxiang Sect]

776
00:38:12,240 --> 00:38:14,130
[In the next episode]

777
00:38:14,650 --> 00:38:15,320
Young Master,

778
00:38:15,320 --> 00:38:16,320
Jialiang and Jiashu

779
00:38:16,320 --> 00:38:17,190
are missing.

780
00:38:17,440 --> 00:38:17,960
What?

781
00:38:18,150 --> 00:38:18,960
Jialiang!

782
00:38:19,360 --> 00:38:19,920
Jiashu!

783
00:38:19,920 --> 00:38:20,630
Jialiang!

784
00:38:20,960 --> 00:38:21,920
Jiashu!

785
00:38:22,760 --> 00:38:23,480
Jialiang!

786
00:38:24,030 --> 00:38:24,760
Jiashu!

787
00:38:25,000 --> 00:38:25,590
Sir,

788
00:38:26,150 --> 00:38:27,440
you must save them.

789
00:38:27,880 --> 00:38:30,070
I'm willing to give up my family business

790
00:38:30,070 --> 00:38:31,230
and my everything

791
00:38:32,030 --> 00:38:33,290
to renovate the temple

792
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:35,800
and rebuild the gold-leaf statue

793
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:36,800
for the Immortal Elder!
